        "slc_9fc90dbc1f2e0f17c2814429e05e9fe34c05e7cc5db21f4edfc5204a43b3e9ac"
      ],
      "text": "Local LLMs are assumed to work only locally, hitting http://localhost:8002/v1/completions with a once-per-second health check that auto-starts the API server process if it is down; a Semaphore limits local LLM requests to one at a time."
    },
