  "summary": "LLMChat is a documented full-stack LLM chat product: a FastAPI backend with a Flutter frontend, WebSocket chat authenticated by server-registered API keys, OpenAI plus local LlamaCpp/Exllama models, Redis-backed vector embedding and context caching, auto-summarization, and token/JWT access-control middleware. Evidence coverage: 146 of 156 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
